/Title (Observation: Most titles were released recently: 2018 has the most releases \(1,147\), followed by 2017 and 2019. Netflix added very little content before 2015, then the number of titles added each year grew rapidly, peaking at 2,016 titles in 2019. Additions fell in 2020 and 2021 \(the 2021 data only runs to September, and production slowed during COVID-19\). Since 2018, TV shows have made up a growing share of new additions \(25% in 2018 to 34% in 2021\).)
